message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Donghyunzooo (동현주): a match-three face laboratory in the manner of Zooo / Zoo Keeper Normal mode, with the starting level and binocular allowance set through the esoteric language Donghyun-lang"
type: software
version: "0.08"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24048918"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
authors:
